    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "85a736920f1e23f4",
      "translationZh": "英语 · 阿拉伯语",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "88f8d5a735d24a13",
      "translationZh": "阿拉伯语 WER：20.92% · 参数：1.6B · 阿联酋语 WER（TII 评估）：22.73%",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "75e54bae4c1afd3d",
      "translationZh": "我们正在推出 Falcon-ASR，这是我们的 16 亿参数语音识别模型，专门针对阿拉伯语，尤其关注阿拉伯联合酋长国方言。该模型由阿布扎比的技术创新研究所（TII）开发，还支持英语、法语、西班牙语和葡萄牙语。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e6f420d4718ae1bd",
      "translationZh": "在我们的评估中，Falcon-ASR 在六个阿拉伯语测试集上的平均词错误率为 20.92%，而我们使用的排行榜快照中公布的最佳结果为 23.17%。在我们内部的阿联酋评估中，它在我们比较的系统中记录了最低的词错误率和字符错误率。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "92e026480cf93d53",
      "translationZh": "我们还支持词级时间戳用于转录，将每个转录的单词与其在音频中的位置关联。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d3328155143a6a88",
      "translationZh": "您可以在我们的 Hugging Face Demo 中尝试 Falcon-ASR。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ae8e9ab03ed3981d",
      "translationZh": "识别口语阿拉伯语",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aa9d81f977f9499a",
      "translationZh": "阿拉伯语的使用因地区、说话者和场景而异。一个能够处理正式新闻广播的模型在面对阿拉伯联合酋长国的对话或通过电话线录制的语音时可能仍会遇到困难。方言阿拉伯语的转录资源比现代标准阿拉伯语（MSA）少，这使得训练和评估变得更加困难。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4543f652ca9fd64e",
      "translationZh": "我们在阿联酋方言、现代标准阿拉伯语（MSA）、其他海湾方言及阿拉伯方言以及英语上训练了 Falcon-ASR。我们的目标是转录人们在日常对话中使用的词汇，包括方言形式以及语言之间的切换。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "46006bb62cf72ffc",
      "translationZh": "阿拉伯语基准测试结果",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "062dbd9bec100997",
      "translationZh": "由 ELM 研究中心维护的 Open Universal Arabic ASR 排行榜通过六个测试集的等权重平均字错率（WER）对系统进行排名。它还报告了字符错误率（CER）。对于这两个指标，数值越低越好。我们的 Falcon-ASR 评估遵循此协议。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e2c614c23f02239",
      "translationZh": "模型",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e68b36b17cbd9908",
      "translationZh": "参数量",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
