      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "898e178d99fcdef9",
      "translationZh": "Cohere 阿拉伯语转录 (07-2026)",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce01aa5654a6105e",
      "translationZh": "20亿",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e6aa704fdfc4c45c",
      "translationZh": "WER = 词错率；CER = 字错率。数值越低表示性能越好。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "44dfb4659b5d6a5c",
      "translationZh": "我们在使用排行榜固定清单的相同六个基准测试上评估了 Falcon-ASR。竞争对手的数据是截至 2026 年 9 月 30 日核查的已发布排行榜平均值。Falcon-ASR 的平均 WER 比该快照中已发布的最佳结果高出 2.25 个百分点。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4996c39c8254d9bb",
      "translationZh": "评估阿联酋方言语音",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1468ea47ff2a137",
      "translationZh": "公开评估数据已经包含了阿联酋方言：Casablanca 包含一个阿联酋子集。我们通过对额外的阿联酋和海湾方言进行内部评估来补充该覆盖范围，使用留出录音和人工验证的转录文本，以评估超出公开阿联酋子集的转录准确性。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a31743654b38eeda",
      "translationZh": "在我们的内部阿联酋方言评估中，Falcon-ASR 实现了 22.73% 的 WER 和 10.19% 的 CER：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e2c614c23f02239",
      "translationZh": "模型",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
