      "translationZh": "20亿",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "832a6b6e757db32e",
      "translationZh": "Falcon-ASR 在本文对比的系统中具有最低的 WER 和 CER。其 WER 比排名第二的 Qwen3-Omni 低 4.07 个百分点。结果显示，在本次评估中，该模型在词级和字符级的转录准确度均有所提高。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a4474a52674497e7",
      "translationZh": "针对不同录音条件的训练",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "36edfed6257369e1",
      "translationZh": "我们加入了背景噪声、重叠语音、音乐、房间混响和电话效应，以及语速和音高的变化。我们对阿联酋语录音也采用了相同的处理方式，使模型能够接触到在会议、通话和其他日常录音中可能遇到的各种情况。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8830a6ee0c999f4b",
      "translationZh": "英语和其他语言",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "369dc6864f188639",
      "translationZh": "Falcon-ASR 使用相同的模型权重进行英语转录。在我们对 Hugging Face Open ASR 排行榜所使用的七个公开英语测试集进行的评估中，它实现了 5.74% 的平均字错率 (WER)。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2cc5a5dc24c8b778",
      "translationZh": "测试集",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "675c87796fcb3334",
      "translationZh": "词错误率（%）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3a40491c3d84b1b4",
      "translationZh": "LibriSpeech 干净",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "29ae76a3afe4882e",
      "translationZh": "LibriSpeech 其他",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b33924fda733b8a",
      "translationZh": "收益-22",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "18282717468673ee",
      "translationZh": "该模型还支持法语、西班牙语和葡萄牙语。所有五种语言都使用相同的权重，无需语言标志。输出结果为所说语言的转录文本。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "75b45deb9b4ab4a9",
      "translationZh": "模型基础",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "863fd495889eb53a",
      "translationZh": "Falcon-ASR 基于我们的 Falcon3-Audio 工作。Falcon3-Audio 的架构和训练方法在《通过在公开数据上进行数据高效的单阶段训练，实现具有竞争力的音频语言模型》一文中进行了描述。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a796e7a38047b647",
      "translationZh": "尝试 Falcon ASR",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "40c00b4c92bcdfda",
      "translationZh": "我们的 Hugging Face Demo Space 让您可以尝试 Falcon-ASR 并探索其转录能力。API 访问和原生应用程序已在计划中。我们邀请您使用自己的录音来尝试该演示。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b3113f926f93eb2d",
      "translationZh": "我们推出 Falcon ASR",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ac874e0b0587c242",
      "translationZh": "我们推出 Falcon-ASR，这是我们用于阿拉伯语语音识别的模型，参数规模为 1.6 亿，特别关注阿拉伯联合酋长国方言。我们在阿布扎比的技术创新研究所（TII）开发了该模型，它还支持英语、法语、西班牙语和葡萄牙语。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5c38c4f3c8d9c63a",
      "translationZh": "在我们的评估中，Falcon-ASR 在六组阿拉伯语测试集上的平均词错误率达到了 20.92%，而我们所使用的排行榜版本中公布的最佳结果为 23.17%。在我们对阿拉伯联合酋长国方言的内部评估中，该模型在我们比较的所有系统中实现了最低的词错误率和字符错误率。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c13765c46e9c97f4",
      "translationZh": "平均 CER (%)",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0121",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d6fe104b8e83958a",
      "translationZh": "WER 是词错率；CER 是字符错率。数值越低表示性能越好。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0122",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ccba9ae23919246d",
      "translationZh": "我们使用排行榜中固定的样本列表，在相同的六个测试集上对 Falcon-ASR 进行了评估。竞争模型的数值是排行榜上公布的平均值，这些数值已于 2026 年 9 月 30 日通过验证。该模型的平均词错率比该版本中公布的最佳结果高出 2.25 个百分点。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0124",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9869119b3eb85bf2",
      "translationZh": "目前已有用于评估阿联酋方言的公开数据，因为 Casablanca 数据集包含一个专门的阿联酋部分。我们通过对额外的阿联酋和海湾地区语音进行内部评估来补充这一覆盖范围，使用专门的测试录音和经过人工审核的参考文本，以评估在公开的阿联酋数据之外，对额外材料转录准确性的表现。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0125",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a422f5521fb08ae6",
      "translationZh": "Falcon-ASR 在我们的内部阿联酋评估中实现了 22.73% 的词错率和 10.19% 的字符错率：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0126",
      "kind": "paragraph",
