    {
      "id": "b0154",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a063fd69777e8d91",
      "translationZh": "Falcon-ASR 在此处对比的所有系统中记录了最低的词错误率和字符错误率。其词错误率比排名第二的 Qwen3-Omni 低了 4.07 个百分点。结果显示，在此评估中，单词和字符级别的转录准确度均有所提高。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0158",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "46cb7ebeba35ee01",
      "translationZh": "Falcon-ASR 使用相同的模型权重对英语语音进行转录。在我们对 Hugging Face 开放语音识别基准测试中使用的七个通用英语测试集进行的评估中，平均词错误率为 5.74%。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0159",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2cc5a5dc24c8b778",
      "translationZh": "测试集",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0160",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "675c87796fcb3334",
      "translationZh": "词错率 (%)",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    }
  ],
